# Post-battle briefing.
<machine_speech><gray>Battle log — outcome: <shining>{result}<\shining>. Duration {ticks} ticks. Own losses {lost}. Enemy destroyed {killed}. Fleet strength {ships}.<\gray>
?if result = victory
<gray>The drill was disrupted. The muster is the tell; the strike is the price of ignoring it.<\gray>
?else
<gray>The strike landed. Note when the muster began and how long it took to launch.<\gray>
?end
?if notes ~ muster
<gray>[ Cross-reference: the operator's notes mention the muster. ]<\gray>
?end
